    - target: {fileID: 2051527669408208780, guid: ce18fb1bfda024936973ca895c2667f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: "Welcome to \n\nIn this kitchen, something strange has happened \u2014
        everyday items have been mysteriously infused with hidden letters. Ingredients,
        tools, and objects around you may all contain pieces of words waiting to
        be discovered.\n\nYou and your teammate take on the roles of Chef and Butcher,
        working together in this chaotic kitchen to uncover the letters hidden inside
        the environment.\n\nExplore what is within your reach, break things open,
        and turn this messy kitchen into a factory of words.\n\nGood luck, and enjoy
        the challenge."
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
