    - target: {fileID: 5703001028324800205, guid: ce18fb1bfda024936973ca895c2667f2, type: 3}
      propertyPath: m_text
      value: 'In this tabletop word-forming game, you will break objects to reveal
        letters and rearrange them to create words and score points.


        Each
        team has two roles: Chef and Butcher. The Chef uses a knife, while the Butcher
        uses a hammer to interact with certain objects.


        Objects require
        different actions. Some can be torn apart by hand, and larger ones may require
        both of you to tear them apart together. Others must be cut with the knife
        or smashed with the hammer.


        The letters revealed can be combined
        to form valid new words. The more words you create, the more points your
        team earns.


        The game takes place in a tabletop environment, so
        you must stay at your position once the game begins. Use the objects within
        your reach, and do not take items from the opposing team.


        When
        time runs out, the team with the highest score wins.'
      objectReference: {fileID: 0}
    - target: {fileID: 5930801629012419606, guid: ce18fb1bfda024936973ca895c2667f2, type: 3}
